{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"10a45bcf2ede9deb41605171c53170d502fcae5c3b35e4565dec7e08e91d0387","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亚伯拉罕买地葬撒拉"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["撒拉享年一百二十七岁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["她在迦南境内的基列·亚巴，即希伯仑去世。亚伯拉罕在那里痛哭，哀悼她。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他从亡妻旁边站起来对赫人说："]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“我在你们中间是异乡客旅，请你们给我一块坟地，我好埋葬我的亡妻。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["赫人答道："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["“我主，请听我们说，你在我们中间是一位尊贵的王子，你可以选我们这里最好的坟地，没有人会反对你使用他的坟地埋葬你的妻子。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["亚伯拉罕就起身向当地的赫人下拜，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["“如果你们愿意让我安葬亡妻，就请答应我，代我求琐辖的儿子以弗仑，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["把他地头的麦比拉洞卖给我。请他当着你们的面按实价卖给我作坟地。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["当时以弗仑正坐在赫人当中，于是他当着所有出入城门口的赫人答复亚伯拉罕说："]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["“不可！我主，请听我说，我当着族人的面，把那块地和其中的山洞送给你。去安葬你的死者吧！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["亚伯拉罕向当地的人下拜，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["当众对以弗仑说：“你若愿意，请听我说，我要把地钱给你，请你收下，好让我在那里安葬我的妻子。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["以弗仑回答说："]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["“我主，请听我说，九十两银子的地对你我来说算什么呢？去安葬你的妻子吧！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["于是，亚伯拉罕听了以弗仑的意思，就照当众提出的价钱，按市价秤了九十两银子给他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["这样，以弗仑在麦比拉、靠近幔利的那块地和山洞及地界内所有的树木，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["都归了亚伯拉罕。这是在城门口的赫人面前买下的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["之后，亚伯拉罕把妻子撒拉安葬在迦南的幔利附近、麦比拉田间的洞里。幔利就是希伯仑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["这块赫人的地和其中的山洞从此成了亚伯拉罕家的坟地。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}